IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-BIONIKA-SCORE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 EVENT-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RENDERED-FRAMES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BIRD-OUTRO-OK       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SCORE-ENERGY        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-BIONIKA-SCORE.
    IF EVENT-COUNT < 20
        GO TO SCORE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF RENDERED-FRAMES < 3969000
        GO TO SCORE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF BIRD-OUTRO-OK == 0
        GO TO SCORE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO SCORE-ENERGY.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 EVENT-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 BIRD-OUTRO-OK.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

SCORE-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO SCORE-ENERGY.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
